"""B2B assistant: fixed, organisation-scoped answers + support tickets for corporate / lab clients.

Every lookup is a fixed read-only query bound to the verified organisation code (never typed by the user, never AI-written SQL).
Requests that need a person (complaint, correction, pickup, escalation, bulk booking ...) become a support ticket in the admin database.
try_answer() returns None when it has nothing to say, so the existing B2B flow (invoices, Excel, report PDF) still runs.
"""
